  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Not Because of Israel's Righteousness",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear, Israel: You are now about to cross the Jordan to go in and dispossess nations greater and stronger than you, with large cities that have walls up to the sky.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people are strong and tall—Anakites! You know about them and have heard it said: \"Who can stand up against the Anakites?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But be assured today that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God is the one who goes across ahead of you like a devouring fire. He will destroy them; he will subdue them before you. And you will drive them out and annihilate them quickly, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has promised you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God has driven them out before you, do not say to yourself, \"The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has brought me here to take possession of this land because of my righteousness.\" No, it is on account of the wickedness of these nations that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is going to drive them out before you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is not because of your righteousness or your integrity that you are going in to take possession of their land; but on account of the wickedness of these nations, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God will drive them out before you, to accomplish what he swore to your fathers, to Abraham, Isaac and Jacob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Understand, then, that it is not because of your righteousness that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God is giving you this good land to possess, for you are a stiff-necked people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Golden Calf",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember this and never forget how you aroused the anger of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God in the wilderness. From the day you left Egypt until you arrived here, you have been rebellious against the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At Horeb you aroused the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s wrath so that he was angry enough to destroy you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I went up on the mountain to receive the tablets of stone, the tablets of the covenant that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had made with you, I stayed on the mountain forty days and forty nights; I ate no bread and drank no water.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gave me two stone tablets inscribed by the finger of God. On them were all the commandments the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "proclaimed to you on the mountain out of the fire, on the day of the assembly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the end of the forty days and forty nights, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gave me the two stone tablets, the tablets of the covenant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "told me, \"Go down from here at once, because your people whom you brought out of Egypt have become corrupt. They have turned away quickly from what I commanded them and have made an idol for themselves.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to me, \"I have seen this people, and they are a stiff-necked people indeed!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me alone, so that I may destroy them and blot out their name from under heaven. And I will make you into a nation stronger and more numerous than they.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I turned and went down from the mountain while it was ablaze with fire. And the two tablets of the covenant were in my hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I looked, I saw that you had sinned against the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God; you had made for yourselves an idol cast in the shape of a calf. You had turned aside quickly from the way that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had commanded you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I took the two tablets and threw them out of my hands, breaking them to pieces before your eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
