                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.9.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was not able to take them into the land he had promised them, and because he hated them, he brought them out to put them to death in the wilderness.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
